thread: 1


desc: I1 cache: 32768 B, 64 B, 8-way associative
desc: D1 cache: 32768 B, 64 B, 8-way associative
desc: LL cache: 8388608 B, 64 B, 16-way associative

desc: Timerange: Basic block 0 - 1000
